{# Area ID travels in every Hello. If the two ends of a link disagree, IOS silently drops the Hello - visible only
   in `debug ip ospf hello` / `debug ip ospf adj` - no adjacency ever starts, and there is no error on the
   interface itself. A classic root cause during area boundary migrations, when one router is re-homed to a new
   area before its neighbor is. #}
interface {{ area1_link_r4_if }}
 ip ospf 1 area {{ 1 if rollback else 0 }}
